She's with Josie.

1084
01:37:35.452 --> 01:37:37.036
This kid, she knows everything.

1085
01:37:42.411 --> 01:37:43.494
It's gonna be okay.

1086
01:37:45.827 --> 01:37:46.911
We're gonna be okay.

1087
